Z||000007||FieroHeather||06-21-2001||11:00 PM||||I havent experienced anything degrading or rude here on PFF since I've joined in May '01.  I think most of the guys here are pretty decent, and the ones who are not are easy to ignore.  Just gotta remember that a lot of what is said in jest is just plain sarcasm.  Honestly? I think the guys in here treat the female members better than they do fellow male members!  <P>If something is outta hand, or outta line, I will voice that in an email first or as a last resort on the forum.  As it stands, everything is a-ok  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Thanks for the space to let us ladies speak!||||reg||14
Z||000008||MsBeth||06-22-2001||12:29 AM||||I have to agree with FieroHeather - both of my experiences on Pennocks have been wonderful...As MsBeth and as GokartsGirl.  The guys were never anything but kind, and helpful.  <P>That is not to say there isn't teasing, but never anything but good natured stuff.<P>Of course most of my time here was spent before there were so many members, however since my return I have had nothing but a great time here and everyone has been amazing!  <P>Thanks to all who make it fun!<P>MsBeth||||reg||14
